    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. I'm seeing a lot of debate specifically about the environmental side of it. From a planning perspective, do most experts see congestion pricing as a necessary step for hitting climate goals, or is that just one way to frame it?",
      "source": "evaluator"
